      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">三块记忆碎片漂浮在空中，裂缝里的光慢慢合拢。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="神秘声音">你已经看到了自己的过去。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="神秘声音">现在告诉我。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="神秘声音">你想改变什么？</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[回答最后的问题|00:10]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 00：30《放弃的梦想》 {"position":"2375,250","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/0030.JPG" alt="堆满旧画本的房间">
