      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="小主角">我不要！</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="小主角">你们根本不懂我！</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">门被重重关上，门外却没有责骂声。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[离开]]</div>
