      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="主角">只是我一直在赌气，不想先低头。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">那句没有说出口的道歉，终于找到了回声。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[获得记忆碎片]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 回答 {"position":"975,625","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
