    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">晚上。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">桌上放着一杯水和一张纸条。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">水已经不热了，纸条却像刚放下不久。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[拾取纸条]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 秒表 {"position":"975,250","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/游戏开始：桌子上的表.jpg" alt="桌子上的怀表">
    <div class="bz-hud">
      <span class="bz-time">怀表</span>
      <span class="bz-place">可交互物件</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">怀表躺在桌面上，表盖半开，里面没有指针。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">当主角伸手时，缺失的指针突然出现。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="怀表">00:60</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[触碰怀表|click countdown]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 结局 {"position":"3425,100","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/结局1.jpg" alt="结局一">
    <div class="bz-hud">
      <span class="bz-time">结局</span>
      <span class="bz-place">回到过去</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">照片被重新拼好，碎片之间却仍然有细细的裂痕。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="主角">也许重要的不是改变过去。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="主角">而是终于愿意珍惜现在。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[走向最后一秒|00:01]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 结局2 {"position":"3425,250","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/结局2.jpg" alt="结局二">
    <div class="bz-hud">
      <span class="bz-time">结局</span>
      <span class="bz-place">留下记忆</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">他收起所有记忆，连同那些刺痛一起放进怀表。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">怀表变得很轻。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="主角">原来遗憾不是要被抹掉的。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="主角">它提醒我，我曾经真正在乎过。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[走向最后一秒|00:01]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 结局3 {"position":"3425,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/结局3.jpg" alt="结局三">
    <div class="bz-hud">
      <span class="bz-time">结局</span>
      <span class="bz-place">停留</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">他永远停留在回忆里。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">门一扇扇关上，怀表却再也没有归零。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="神秘声音">有些人以为留住过去，就能不必离开。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="神秘声音">可停下来的，从来不只是时间。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[走向最后一秒|00:01]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 获得记忆碎片 {"position":"1750,250","size":"100,100"}
