      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="旁白">碎片落入怀表，表盘上多出一道温暖的刻痕。</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="神秘声音">下一扇门已经打开。</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[进入第二扇门|00：40《错过的约定》]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 获得记忆碎片2 {"position":"2250,375","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art bz-scene-art-door-echo" src="Images/三扇门.jpg" alt="三扇门">
    <img class="bz-scene-art is-contain" src="Images/记忆碎片2.png" alt="没有完成的约定">
